%% RBAC and permissions resolution
%% Status: current | Related: apps/api/src/lib/rbac.js, docs/blueprint/rbac_multitenancy.mmd
flowchart TD
  User[Authenticated user] --> Role{Platform role}
  Role -->|ADMIN| AdminCtx[Admin context\nadmin permissions]
  Role -->|RESTAURANT/SUPPLIER| TenantCtx[Tenant context\ntenantId + tenantType]
  TenantCtx --> OrgRole{Org model?}
  OrgRole -->|yes| OrgPerm[restaurant_org_* / org_* roles\nbranch access table]
  OrgRole -->|no| TenantRole[tenant_user_roles + tenant_role_permissions]
  TenantCtx --> Sub[Subscription entitlements]
  Sub --> FeatGate[requireFeature middleware]
  Sub --> LimGate[requireWithinLimit / checkLimit]
  AdminCtx --> Impersonate[Optional impersonation\nsee admin/impersonation-flow.mmd]
  Removed[approvals_budgets — removed product-wide] -.x FeatGate
